        "pf_9abb21ac_value": "The Smart Mid-Mount Drive consists of four key components: Removable Propulsion Module; Removable LiFePO₄ Battery Module; Integrated 3-Button Foot-Control Base; Tool-Free Quick-Release Propeller.<br>The battery is not built into the motor. It is a separate removable LiFePO₄ battery module that connects to the propulsion system. This modular design allows for easy installation, charging, replacement, and transportation.",
        "pf_223bc29d_value": " Double-Layer Protection. Twice the Confidence on the Water.Engineered with dual-layer PVC + drop-stitch core &amp; polyester mesh — tougher against gear, rocks, and wear. Built to last, built for adventure.<br>",
        "pf_d1065a43_value": " Double-Layer Protection. Twice the Confidence on the Water.Engineered with dual-layer PVC + drop-stitch core &amp; polyester mesh — tougher against gear, rocks, and wear. Built to last, built for adventure.<br>",
        "pf_66d3333f_value": " Double-Layer Protection. Twice the Confidence on the Water.Engineered with dual-layer PVC + drop-stitch core &amp; polyester mesh — tougher against gear, rocks, and wear. Built to last, built for adventure.",
        "pf_1e0ff322_value": " Double-Layer Protection. Twice the Confidence on the Water.Engineered with dual-layer PVC + drop-stitch core &amp; polyester mesh — tougher against gear, rocks, and wear. Built to last, built for adventure.",
        "pf_44ccaf83_value": " Double-Layer Protection. Twice the Confidence on the Water.Engineered with dual-layer PVC + drop-stitch core &amp; polyester mesh — tougher against gear, rocks, and wear. Built to last, built for adventure.",
        "pf_b818cbd8_value": "The mid-mount drive is positioned for easier manual access, allowing you to lift and clear the propeller when conditions require. Reduce speed and operate carefully in weeds or shallow water.",
        "pf_0066e9c7_value": "The TwinTube Stabilizer Hull rides on two water-contact air beams that deliver dynamic buoyancy compensation — far steadier than a standard kayak, so you can stand and fish with confidence. ",
        "pf_833bb399_value": "The TwinTube Stabilizer Hull rides on two water-contact air beams that deliver dynamic buoyancy compensation — far steadier than a standard kayak, so you can stand and fish with confidence. ",
        "pf_bee6de06_value": "The TwinTube Stabilizer Hull rides on two water-contact air beams that deliver dynamic buoyancy compensation — far steadier than a standard kayak, so you can stand and fish with confidence. ",
        "pf_2f464542_value": "The TwinTube Stabilizer Hull rides on two water-contact air beams that deliver dynamic buoyancy compensation — far steadier than a standard kayak, so you can stand and fish with confidence. ",
        "pf_8b67424d_value": "Marine-grade GPS holds your position within ±1 m through wind and current. Five modes — Anchor Lock, Course &amp; Speed Hold, Track Recording, Bidirectional Track Following, and Drift.",
        "pf_e7bce255_value": "Marine-grade GPS holds your position within ±1 m through wind and current. Five modes — Anchor Lock, Course &amp; Speed Hold, Track Recording, Bidirectional Track Following, and Drift.",
        "pf_b22175a5_value": "Ventral is designed around an inflatable hull and removable drive components, so the system can pack down between trips instead of demanding permanent trailer or garage space. ",
        "pf_5f88a823_value": "An oversized inflatable seat sits 20% higher than a standard kayak seat, with contoured leg support and lumbar backing — comfortable all day, with no added weight.",
        "pf_93bd0ab1_value": "An oversized inflatable seat sits 20% higher than a standard kayak seat, with contoured leg support and lumbar backing — comfortable all day, with no added weight.",
        "pf_a392dcc4_value": "The wide TwinTube platform is designed to support stand-and-cast fishing. Always consider water conditions and use appropriate personal flotation equipment.",
        "pf_d00703f5_value": "The mid-mount motor sits directly in front of you. When weeds catch the prop, lift it straight up and clear it by hand — no reaching the stern, no tools. ",
        "pf_ce60c220_value": "Runtime varies with speed, load, water conditions, wind, and control use. Verified runtime results and test conditions will be published before launch.",
        "pf_bc3864f6_value": "Ventral is designed to pack down for car-friendly transport without requiring a dedicated trailer. Vehicle fit depends on available cargo space.",
        "pf_8dd74879_value": "Integrated mounting bases and rail tracks accept standard rod holders, fish finders, and camera mounts — configure the platform to your needs.",
        "pf_0f9b5a06_value": "Integrated mounting bases and rail tracks accept standard rod holders, fish finders, and camera mounts — configure the platform to your needs.",
        "pf_12ef91c4_value": "Accessories shown in images may be for demonstration purposes. Only items listed in the final Kickstarter reward description are included.",
        "pf_71eb79b7_value": "A wide, open deck with dedicated zones — bow storage, mid-deck tackle access, and a stern cooler or crate bay — configured to your setup.",
        "pf_ad6f396b_value": "A wireless remote and app with voice assist hold heading, speed, or position, so you can focus on fishing instead of managing the craft.",
        "pf_b32298be_value": "A wireless remote and app with voice assist hold heading, speed, or position, so you can focus on fishing instead of managing the craft.",
