        "pf_80fc352e_value": "Ventral is a powered inflatable fishing kayak built around a mid-mount drive, an open fishing deck, and seated or standing fishing.",
        "pf_f5bdbb99_value": "Join the Ventral Kickstarter launch list for proof footage, product updates, and reward details as final information is confirmed.",
